      "statement": "Grant validity is a monotonic fixed point over match-based upstream coverage — same dataOwner, upstream grantee equal to the downstream grantedBy, same shape tree, registration and storage, plus scope, access-mode, creator-mode and instance coverage — so chains without a source grant stay invalid and mutual delegations cannot bootstrap a cycle.",
